WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:10.019
Today I am going to explain a Polish cult
comedy science fiction film called “Seksmisja.”

00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:11.960
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:18.600
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:25.340
In 1991, two common men named Max Paradys
and Albert Starski volunteer for the first

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.680
human hibernation experiment.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.610
Max is looking for adventure in his life and
a time away from his wife and daughter while

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.310
Albert is a biologist who wants to be known
for something great.

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:42.000
Hence, they are ready to go into hibernation
pods created by professor Wiktor Kuppelweiser.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The professor is a Nobel Prize laureate, who
has successfully hibernated a chimpanzee for

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.239
half a year, so the men believe they will
be safe.

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:54.670
The experiment is considered a revolutionary
event that is about to change the course of

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:55.960
human history.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.280
In the official announcement of the initiation
of the experiment, it is said that the hibernation

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.160
is scheduled to last for 3 years.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:10.359
Max and Albert are finally put into the pods
as the world watches in anticipation.

00:01:10.359 --> 00:01:19.109
However, Instead of being awakened 3 years
later in 1994 as planned, they wake up in

00:01:19.109 --> 00:01:21.329
the year 2044.

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:25.789
They have been in the pod for fifty-three
years but haven't aged a day.

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:30.170
Unknown to this, When the two wake up, they
believe that they are in a facility following

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:32.329
their post-hibernation checkup.

00:01:32.329 --> 00:01:36.240
They are joyful as they anticipate fame and
money for their bravery.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:40.920
The facility keeps them in confinement for
some days as they are taken care of by women.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:45.740
As time goes by, the two start suspecting
why they haven’t seen a single man since

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:47.060
they woke up.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.939
One of their caretakers is named Lamia Reno.

00:01:49.939 --> 00:01:53.649
She keeps an eye on the two through cameras
and observes them all day.

00:01:53.649 --> 00:01:57.579
On the third day, they explicitly ask to meet
professor Kuppelweiser.

00:01:57.579 --> 00:02:02.960
But are informed by Lamia and doctor Berna
that Kuppelweiser doesn't exist.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:07.169
They explain to the guys that a nuclear war
broke out several years ago which caused all

00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:09.549
males of the world to go extinct.

00:02:09.549 --> 00:02:15.319
The date currently is the 8th of March 2044,
meaning that the guys are eighty-six years

00:02:15.319 --> 00:02:16.319
old.

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:20.049
Max and Albert refuse to believe this and
assume that they are being tested upon.

00:02:20.049 --> 00:02:24.290
They also realize that the room they are staying
in has no windows and try to leave through

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.000
the door, only to receive an electric shock.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.610
At night, the men are distressed and still
confused.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:34.780
Lamia senses their confusion and talks to
them through a microphone fitted in their

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.780
room.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:41.310
She reveals that their society reproduces
without males through a process called parthenogenesis.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:46.180
The women suppress their sexual urges by taking
a mandatory drug, so there is no need for

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.000
men altogether.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.340
While watching the television, Max sees that
women frequently walk around naked because

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:53.829
of the absence of men.

00:02:53.829 --> 00:02:58.569
He gets an idea to take advantage of their
situation and get with as many women as possible

00:02:58.569 --> 00:03:00.739
because there are no male competitors.

00:03:00.739 --> 00:03:05.310
So, during a briefing, Max kisses Lamia to
test the waters.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:09.810
She furiously accuses him of sexual assault
and knocks him down easily.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:15.800
A few days later, Max and Albert are summoned
by the supreme leader of the women, Her Excellency.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.340
They are taken to a bio sanctuary where post-war
animals and trees are preserved.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:25.909
In the meeting, they ask what exactly happened
to mankind and how did men extinct.

00:03:25.909 --> 00:03:29.030
The women explain that the extinction was
men’s own fault.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:33.079
In the war, doctor Kuppelweiser invented an
agent called the M bomb.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:39.079
The bomb was supposed to temporarily paralyze
male genes that he planned to use as a bioweapon.

00:03:39.079 --> 00:03:43.739
But due to an oversight, it destroyed male
genes permanently, causing the extinction

00:03:43.739 --> 00:03:45.200
of male species.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:50.439
Max offers to serve as reproducers to restore
the male population, and change the society

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:51.640
to how it was.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:55.950
However, the women do not wish the old order
to return because they have been taught that

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.599
men terrorized and enslaved them back in the
day.

00:03:59.599 --> 00:04:03.430
After the meeting, the guys are taken back
to confinement but Lamia cannot get the thought

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.019
of Max out of her head.

00:04:05.019 --> 00:04:08.790
The kiss has caused her drug-inhibited passions
to resurface.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.099
Due to her internal feelings, she goes on
a search for the oldest living woman to find

00:04:13.099 --> 00:04:16.120
out anything she can about the men before
the war.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:21.370
She finds 74-year old Julia and shows her
a video of Max and Albert showering.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.820
Seeing the guys naked reminds Julia of her
fiancé.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:28.730
According to her, the world with both sexes
should be restored.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:32.440
Lamia leaves with a new way to look at life
after the meeting.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:36.540
Meanwhile, as Max and Albert stay in confinement
they grow distressed.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:41.070
Albert sees wires on their room’s floor
and devises a plan to escape by damaging the

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.530
electric power grid.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:46.530
They put their plan into action the next day
and easily succeed.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:49.730
While running around, they end up in a room
where little girls are being taught how to

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:53.590
interact with men if they were ever to come
in contact with them.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.620
Soon, the guys are caught and are locked up
again.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:00.750
After the commotion, the women are furious,
but they still provide Max and Albert a chance

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.240
to redeem themselves.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:07.030
They want the guys to undergo sex reassignment
surgery and turn into women to be accepted

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.240
in society.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:13.021
When they refuse, the ceiling above the room
opens, showing a huge assembly of women, who

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:14.900
are to determine their fate.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:20.310
The hearing starts and goes on for a long
time as the assembly blames men for oppression,

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:24.570
virtually all evil and vices, and praises
their new society.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:29.940
They even claim that the greatest scientists
- such as Copernicus, Einstein, and Pincus

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.240
were, in fact, women.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:37.080
When Max and Albert are taken away, the assembly
votes on whether the men should undergo forced

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.450
'naturalization' or be 'liquidated'.

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:44.020
Lamia thinks she should have a say in the
matter because she is the one who dug the

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.420
hibernation pod and found them.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:52.270
However, voting takes place and Naturalization
is passed by a margin of only one vote.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:57.320
As the discussion is taking place, the men
escape again, wandering through the facility

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.350
and getting lost every few minutes.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:04.360
All the women they encounter have never seen
a man before so they mistake the two for fellow

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.360
“sisters”.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:09.710
Max is distracted on the way by naked girls
swimming in an aquarium.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:14.460
After that, the men escape down a waste chute
where they discover a group of women singing,

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.530
dancing, and having fun.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:20.640
Some of them are also engaging in lesbian
relations which fascinates Max.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:26.770
It turns out that the group consists of rebellious
hippies who do not want to follow Her Excellency’s

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:27.770
order.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:30.510
They mistake Max and Albert for government
spies.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:35.500
Soon, the police force comes looking for them
and they manage to escape only to be caught

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.540
by Lamia again.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.710
She tells them that the facility they are
living in is underground and takes them to

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.710
the entrance.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:47.040
Then, using a periscope they watch the current
condition of the surface of the earth.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.870
It is a dark, rocky landscape above ground
that has high levels of "Kuppelweiser radiation",

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.440
a side effect of the M bomb.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:59.980
She shows them the reality so they would quit
trying to escape.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.420
The officials praise her for her intelligence
but do not provide her full authority over

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.810
the men which devastates Lamia.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:11.180
Instead, Max and Albert are handed to an old
doctor named Yanda.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.830
She decides that the men’s organs will be
extracted for transplantation, and their remains

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:21.010
will be tested for possible use as a food
source, due to a growing protein shortage.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:25.420
When Max is on the hospital bed, it is revealed
that Yanda is actually his daughter, who now

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.930
hates him because he abandoned her mother
when she was little.

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:33.050
Both men are strapped to the hospital bed
being prepared for the surgery when Lamia

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.600
comes to their aid.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.350
She helps them escape as revenge for the officials
taking the men.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:42.630
Shortly after escaping, Albert passes out
in the elevator from the anesthetic given

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.630
to him.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:48.840
As Lamia tries to revive him, he dreams that
he's in 1994, and the process of hibernation

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:50.860
has successfully finished.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:55.240
After he comes back to his senses, they rush
to the periscope room, planning to escape

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.680
to the surface, despite the radiation.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.580
Lamia threatens the guards to give her the
code to activate a capsule that will take

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.830
them to the surface, but the guards claim
they do not know it.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.640
In the meantime, Max and Albert quickly change
into protective suits.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:13.070
The guards claim that only Her Excellency
knows the password which makes the three believe

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.530
they are about to be caught.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:19.800
Enraged, Max curses, saying “your mother's
a whore”, and to the surprise of all present,

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.770
the capsule is activated.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:26.080
Lamia also changes into another protective
suit and the three finally make it to the

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.080
surface.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:31.240
While exploring it, Max walks a few steps
and suddenly bumps against something that

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.350
seems to be an invisible barrier.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:38.650
He takes a knife and cuts the fabric of the
barrier, revealing daylight on the other side.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:43.760
They all go through the hole and to their
utmost surprise, find themselves on a beach.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:48.280
The area that was visible with the periscope
was surrounded by a small, circular tent-like

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:53.270
structure with the barren landscape panorama
painted on the inside of the canvas.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.890
The three explore their surroundings and eventually
reach a forest.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.320
The guys are joyful to finally see a sight
of their old lives.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.770
However, the suits start running out of oxygen.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:09.240
Suddenly Max shouts with joy and throws away
his suit, pointing upwards to a flying stork.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:13.040
According to him, if the bird can breathe,
it means they can too.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:16.390
They take their suits off and are wooshed
with fresh oxygen.

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:22.680
A while later, they come across a fully furnished
cozy villa full of fresh food and modern technology.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:27.270
They are confused about who it belongs to
but do not question the matter further.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:30.650
Instead, the three enjoy a delicious meal
in the garden.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:35.670
Meanwhile, back in the facility, Lamia’s
coworker named Emma gets in a suit and comes

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.430
out looking for the three.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:41.770
Since there is only one suit left, the others
wish her luck and stay back.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:45.920
She also finds out that the world outside
is completely different than what they had

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:46.920
thought.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:51.110
Eventually, she finds Lamia, Max, and Albert
eating in the garden and points her weapon

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.110
at them.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:54.930
But she faints due to the lack of oxygen.

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:58.340
Albert removes her helmet and performs CPR
on her.

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:01.670
He carries her inside the villa and starts
to remove her suit.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:05.620
She quickly regains consciousness and feels
attracted towards Albert.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:10.710
Max, on the other hand, goes with Lamia to
a bedroom and explains to her what mating

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.710
is.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.140
At last, both couples have intercourse.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:18.360
Later, the girls are in the bath while the
men are resting in the living room.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:22.520
Max and Albert hear a noise and hide, assuming
it is the owner of the house.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:27.970
A few seconds later, Her Excellency emerges
from an elevator hidden within a closet.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.779
Max attacks her, demanding answers.

00:10:30.779 --> 00:10:35.790
During the ensuing fight, Her Excellency's
breasts and hair are stripped, revealing that

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.160
he is actually a male in disguise.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:43.020
'Her' Excellency finally tells the men his
life story - just after the war, when the

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:48.100
League of Women took power, he was 4 years
old; the few boys remaining were naturalized

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.820
into girls, but he was hidden by his mother.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:55.970
He joined the League to seem more feminine
and eventually was elected 'Her Excellency'.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:11:01.340
He wanted to keep the women confined inside
the facility and rule over them, so he exaggerated

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.440
the radiation level in order to keep them
under control.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:08.820
Max and Albert make a deal with 'Her' Excellency's,
claiming that they will not reveal his true

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:13.240
identity if they are allowed to stay in the
home with Lamia and Emma.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.720
“Her” Excellency accepts the offer.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:20.340
In the following scene, Max and Albert are
in the facility’s incubation chamber disguised

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.029
as laboratory workers.

00:11:22.029 --> 00:11:27.279
They add male gametes to incubation flasks,
in order to restore the male sex.

00:11:27.279 --> 00:11:29.710
Several months later when the babies are finally
developed.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:33.600
A nurse is horrified to see a male infant.

